msgid ""
"This sensor can be purchased directly from `Blue Robotics "
"<https://bluerobotics.com/store/sensors-sonars-cameras/sonar/ping-"
"sonar-r2-rp/>`__"
msgstr ""
"本传感器可直接从 `Blue Robotics <https://bluerobotics.com/store/sensors-sonars-"
"cameras/sonar/ping-sonar-r2-rp/>`__ 购买。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:17
#: 0ce7a84a8dc2477c8edbe0eee33b8cdf 227cc2175def4884abeb9446ea83fe32
#: aa2839e591d44ef4b717ae6b3b75a8b2 eb5fe117bc7f4b538513e02c1595d5c5
#: f6dce02ce95c433891a2d3eda1189534
msgid ""
"Optionally the `BLUART USB to Serial RS485 adapter "
"<https://bluerobotics.com/store/comm-control-power/tether-"
"interface/bluart-r1-rp/>`__ allows connecting the sensor to a PC for "
"testing, or to a Companion computer"
msgstr ""
"可选配 `BLUART USB 转 RS485 串口适配器 <https://bluerobotics.com/store/comm-control-"
"power/tether-interface/bluart-r1-rp/>`__，用于将传感器连接到PC进行测试，或连接至伴飞计算机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:20
#: 289bc8d48ef347e6a531ce29770f4448 4dd182f2553c4f35abcb8a8557e9cd2e
#: 88d81e894d214450a1432ce32f6a6279 b7d237a4d4d5445dbe9e5c10c84cba59
#: bca7d55e90df4f6491283000edcdb673
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接至飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:22
#: 3dbc68a0ed0448359964412d6665c76e 3de8a9954e00487fabf3c64d5f4cf50c
#: 663a295787ee4fbd9831f9d099bc5468 afc06684e276439ba69eee6ee347e73a
#: f785f71b71644c108a78e80004358a5f
msgid ""
"For a serial connection you can use any spare Serial/UART port.  The diagram"
" below shows how to connect to SERIAL2."
msgstr "对于串行连接，可使用任意空闲的串口/UART。下图展示了如何连接至SERIAL2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:27
#: 09923fe4de504599869d085e3d57d2a8 1b0f146a79044f18a034e1ac4b9df46d
